OL,3,APope delivers veiled rebuke of Milei's
OL,4,Aausterity measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FPope Leo XIV has said Argentina's
OL,7,Feconomy must benefit everyone including
OL,8,Fthe poor, in a diplomatic but pointed
OL,9,Fcritique of President Javier Milei's
OL,10,Fausterity measures.
OL,12,FThe Pope was speaking as he arrived in
OL,13,FBuenos Aires, the second stop on a
OL,14,F12-day tour of Latin America, only
OL,15,Fthree weeks after having had surgery
OL,16,Ffor lung cancer.
OL,18,FIn response, right-wing leader Milei
OL,19,Fsaid his government was working to
OL,20,Favoid "punishing the Argentines of
OL,21,Ftomorrow in order to benefit the
OL,22,FArgentines of today".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
