OL,3,APope delivers veiled rebuke of Milei's
OL,4,Aausterity measures
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis leg of the Pope's journey was
OL,7,Fexpected be the most politically
OL,8,Fsensitive, with the president's agenda
OL,9,Fof slashing public spending having been
OL,10,Fdenounced by the Catholic Church for
OL,11,Fhitting the poorest hardest.
